# --- Azurite (the local Azure Storage emulator the integration tests use) ---
# Generated in the repository root when the integration tests run; pure runtime state. Without
# Azurite that batch of integration tests silently skips rather than fails; start it and you get
# this pile instead. Deleting it only throws away test data, the next run recreates it.
AzuriteConfig
__azurite_db_*.json
__blobstorage__/
__queuestorage__/
__tablestorage__/

